lines += ['','## Every local and remote branch','', 'See `branches.tsv` for the full branch table and `inventory-enriched.json` for exact commit lists, patch-equivalence output, changed paths, worktree status and merge-base evidence. Every branch is retained; no branch has been discarded based on date or PR availability.','','## Assessment meanings','','- `ANCESTRY_IN_MAIN`: branch tip is already reachable from measured main.','- `PATCH_EQUIVALENT_IN_MAIN`: all branch-only non-merge patches match history on main; this is history evidence, not proof against a later revert.','- `CHANGED_PATHS_IDENTICAL_TO_MAIN`: with a proven common ancestor, all branch-changed path contents match current main.','- `POSSIBLE_SQUASH_OR_PARTIAL_IN_MAIN`: matching subjects and/or partial byte equality; needs semantic reconciliation.','- `UNIQUE_OR_REBASED_REQUIRES_REVIEW`: remaining differences; not proof every line must be restored.','- `DIVERGENT_HISTORY_REQUIRES_REVIEW`: no common ancestor; triple-dot comparison is unavailable. Never interpreted as empty or already integrated.','- `ARCHIVE_REQUIRES_CONTENT_TRIAGE`: archive content retained and inventoried; name is not a rejection reason.','','## Freshness and scope','','Root reported fetching CellProtocol, Binding, DiMyMicropayments, DiMyMint and HavenAgentD during this audit; their refreshed remote refs are included. Remaining remote refs are potentially stale. Sprout was specifically found missing the object for the pin used by current HavenAgentD/main. Root is integrating concurrently; refs/worktrees created after this snapshot are outside this report. CellScaffold and its worktrees belong to another audit slice. Ignored files were not exhaustively scanned; Git status inventories tracked/untracked nonignored paths. Credential contents and real user runtime data were not inspected.']
